M10_CH04_B_A01	M10_CH04	Quadratic Formula Application	Basic	Find the roots of the quadratic equation 3x^2 - 5x + 2 = 0 using the quadratic formula.	{"steps": [{"marks": 2.0, "step_no": 1, "description": "Identify a=3, b=-5, c=2 and state formula x = (-b ± √(b^2 - 4ac)) / 2a"}, {"marks": 1.5, "step_no": 2, "description": "Substitute values: D = (-5)^2 - 4(3)(2) = 25 - 24 = 1"}, {"marks": 1.5, "step_no": 3, "description": "Calculate roots x = (5 ± 1)/6 => x = 1 and x = 2/3"}]}	5.0	Cat_A	Application	Foundation	\N	[]	\N	t	\N	\N	f	MATH	All India
M10_CH04_B_A02	M10_CH04	Simple Word Problem - Number Theory	Basic	The sum of two numbers is 15 and the sum of their reciprocals is 3/10. Find the numbers.	{"steps": [{"marks": 2.0, "step_no": 1, "description": "Let numbers be x and (15-x). Form equation 1/x + 1/(15-x) = 3/10"}, {"marks": 1.5, "step_no": 2, "description": "Simplify to quadratic equation x^2 - 15x + 50 = 0"}, {"marks": 1.5, "step_no": 3, "description": "Factorize (x-10)(x-5) = 0 to get numbers 10 and 5"}]}	5.0	Cat_A	Word_Problem	Standard	\N	[]	\N	t	\N	\N	f	MATH	All India
