M10_CH14_STD_401	M10_CH14	Two Dice Sum Distribution	Standard	Two dice, one blue and one grey, are thrown at the same time. Find the probability that the sum of the two numbers appearing on top is: (i) 8 (ii) 13 (iii) less than or equal to 12.	{"rubric": "Total outcomes = 36. (i) Sum 8: {(2,6),(3,5),(4,4),(5,3),(6,2)} = 5/36. (ii) Sum 13: 0/36 = 0. (iii) Sum <= 12: All 36 outcomes => 36/36 = 1."}	4.0	Long_Answer	Apply	Medium	\N	[]	\N	t	\N	\N	f	MATH	All India
